# Heavy dev-only directories — not needed for the production build
factory-screenshots
# dev-only scraping reference images (gitignored, ~8k files / 95MB) — not served in the app
public/images/factory
node_modules
DESIGN-IS-2026-06-05
plans
visual-qa

# One-off dev/scrape scripts — exclude from the Vercel upload…
*.mjs
# …but KEEP build-critical config files (they are also .mjs).
# Without postcss.config.mjs, Tailwind v4's `@import "tailwindcss"` is never
# processed → no CSS is generated and the build fails.
!postcss.config.mjs
!eslint.config.mjs

# NOTE: do NOT ignore `public/` — it holds logo.png and /images/** used
# across Nav, Footer, builders, fabrics, and product galleries.

# …but DO exclude the generated PNG masters. They average 2 MB (1.13 GB total)
# and exist only as the provenance anchor for QC: publish_approved.mjs proves
# byte-identity between these and the graded candidate-N.png. The catalog serves
# the .webp derivatives beside them (75.8 MB total, 93% smaller), which is what
# actually needs to ship. Masters stay in git and on disk for re-verification.
public/images/generated/**/*.png
